    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits entering into or increasing credit contracts for reverse mortgages that are not suitable for the debtor.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(6) Subsection (7) applies if:  (a) the defendant is a credit provider who has contravened section 133 by entering into, or increasing the credit limit of, a credit contract (the illegal contract) that is not a credit contract for a reverse mortgage; and";
