    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Within";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The credit contract was entered into within the period in which an assessment needed to be made.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(6) Subsection (7) applies if:  (c) the court is satisfied that, at any time in the period in which an assessment needed to be made to comply with section 128 in relation to the illegal contract:";
