    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Recurring";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The debtor would have been eligible to enter into a credit contract for the reverse mortgage.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(6) Subsection (7) applies if:  (ii) the debtor would have been eligible to enter into a credit contract for the reverse mortgage; and";
